WEBVTT

00:18:28.996 --> 00:18:30.996
par katru Frenkiju un katru Inesi tur ārā.

00:18:30.996 --> 00:18:33.996
Bet tu vari vismaz izmantot savu balsi, lai

00:18:33.996 --> 00:18:36.996
apturētu politiķus darīt muļķīgas lietas,

00:18:36.996 --> 00:18:38.996
kas izplata HIV.

00:18:38.996 --> 00:18:40.996
Paldies.

00:18:40.996 --> 00:18:49.996
(Aplausi)